          "vector_tops.16": "Assumed unchanged 950 vector datapath. 120 cores * 1.8 GHz * 128 scalar MAC per issue * 2 issues/cycle * 2 ops/MAC = 110.592 TFLOP/s. Dual issue is counted once.",
